[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    285[0m:[38;5;10m[49m fn row16_nch_overflowing_16x() {
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    286[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     // `16 * nch` overflows int; C wraps mod 2^32 then sign-extends.
